> [!NOTE]
> The rule is syntactic. The return type may not be a type alias, even one defined to be the [unit type].
>
> ```rust,compile_fail
> type Unit = ();
>
> #[unsafe(naked)]
> unsafe extern "custom" fn f() -> Unit { // ERROR: Not explicit `()`.
>     core::arch::naked_asm!("ret")
> }
> ```

